  // ── Osysharp.KnowledgeBase · KnowledgeSettingsEditor ──
  /// KnowledgeSettingsEditor · a description
  /// shown through SettingsPage.description
  description "Articles are written as drafts and published as numbered versions. With review on, a version is published by somebody other than the person who wrote it." => "تُكتب المقالات كمسودات وتُنشر كنسخ مرقّمة. عند تشغيل المراجعة، ينشر النسخة شخص غير الذي كتبها.";
  /// KnowledgeSettingsEditor · text on the page
  /// shown through SaveBar.saved
  text "Knowledge base settings saved." => "حُفظت إعدادات قاعدة المعرفة.";

  // ── Osysharp.KnowledgeBase · KnowledgeSettingsFields ──
  /// KnowledgeSettingsFields · a description
